      "id": "claim_65192b27b65349e4b117c05181e5e9a5",
      "statement": "Arcade systems never run the 1G1R election: BIOS sets and parents go to 1G1R when REGIONS_ONE_ARCADE lists their type, else to the system directory when REGIONS_ALL_ARCADE does, else to Trash, and clones can only go to the system directory or Trash.",
