    {
      "id": "claim_f926e9888567420da6b0fc60a11824a2",
      "statement": "trim_ignored_games first partitions out games whose pipe-joined games.categories contain a DISCARD_CATEGORIES entry, on arcade systems as on consoles, then trim_ignored_names discards console games whose No-Intro Languages token names none of LANGUAGES, whose release status is in DISCARD_RELEASES, or whose flag group or any of its flags is in DISCARD_FLAGS, and arcade games whose DAT comment contains a DISCARD_RELEASES entry; every branch calls it unconditionally and the name pass returns early only when all three name lists are empty, so LANGUAGES discards on its own.",
      "evidence": [
