      "id": "claim_72b1e863650f4e088ff4ee44bb273006",
      "statement": "Sortings and file moves share one transaction: the move plan is printed as a summary and applied only on confirmation or --yes, renaming files, updating romfiles rows and pruning emptied directories up to the system directory before committing; declining rolls back the sortings too, and system completion is recomputed whenever a sorting changed.",
