    {
      "id": "claim_471dde29ca124608bae4db713ae55af3",
      "statement": "INFER_CLONES only takes effect when the system's DAT declares no clone games at all; games are then grouped by title — the No-Intro name minus regions, languages, versions, release status and edition flags, which travel with the game, while media, disc and distinct flags keep — and a name No-Intro parsing rejects is its own title; PREFER_PARENTS is switched off for such groups since they have no parent.",
