      "statement": "Imported Retool clone lists override title grouping where they match: the most specific clone_list_titles row whose conditions (match_regions, match_languages, match_string) the game meets wins — full names and regexes outrank short search terms, ties going to the earliest row — and the game joins that row's group_name with its priority, which sorts ahead of the election weights.",
